#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:4
msgid "Check controller health"
msgstr "检查控制器健康状态"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page documents the behavior of LMCache's in-process mode "
"(deprecated). Please consider using :doc:`LMCache MP mode </mp/index>` "
"for better feature support and performance."
msgstr "本页面记录了 LMCache 的进程内模式（已弃用）的行为。请考虑使用 :doc:`LMCache MP 模式 </mp/index>` 以获得更好的功能支持和性能。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:11
msgid "The ``health`` interface is defined as the following:"
msgstr "``health`` 接口定义如下："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:17
msgid ""
"The function returns an ``event_id`` and a dictionary mapping "
"``worker_id`` to ``error_code``. A value of ``0`` indicates a healthy "
"worker, while a non-zero value signals an error."
msgstr ""
"该函数返回一个 ``event_id`` 和一个将 ``worker_id`` 映射到 ``error_code`` 的字典。值为 ``0`` "
"表示工作正常，而非零值则表示出现错误。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:22
msgid "Example usage:"
msgstr "示例用法："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:24
msgid ""
"First, start the lmcache controller at port 9000 and the monitor at port "
"9001:"
msgstr "首先，在 9000 端口启动 lmcache 控制器，在 9001 端口启动监视器："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:30
msgid "Then send a health check request:"
msgstr "然后发送健康检查请求："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:38
msgid "The controller responds with a message similar to the following:"
msgstr "控制器会返回类似于以下内容的消息："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/health.rst:44
msgid ""
"Here ``error_codes`` lists each worker's ``error_code``. ``0`` represents"
" a healthy worker, while non-zero values indicate an error."
msgstr "这里 ``error_codes`` 列出了每个工作者的 ``error_code``。 ``0`` 表示工作者健康，而非零值则表示出现错误。"

